{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04867","headline":"自汤还都经龙门北溪赠张左丞崔礼部崔光禄 · 韦嗣立","name":"自汤还都经龙门北溪赠张左丞崔礼部崔光禄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖闲有愚谷，好事枉朝轩。\n树接前驱拥，岩传後骑喧。\n褰帘出野院，植杖候柴门。\n既拂林下席，仍携池上樽。\n深期契幽赏，实谓展欢言。\n末眷诚未易，佳游时更敦。\n俄看啸俦侣，各已共飞骞。\n延睇尽朝日，长怀通夜魂。\n空闻岸竹动，徒见浦花繁。\n多愧春莺曲，相求意独存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦嗣立","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}